<div style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 3pt; text-align: right;">&#9744;</div>

<div style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 6pt;text-indent:3pt;">&#160;</div>

